Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Kainote's xy-VSFilter source changes

Extends the CSRI entry points (csriapi.cpp) with the colour formats and the
direct SimpleSubPicProvider path Kainote renders through, and carries the
accumulated subtitle/subpic fixes this fork has made since 2018.

Extracted against upstream Cyberbeing/xy-VSFilter 591a14c; see PATCHES.md.

